1
00:00:00,015 --> 00:00:01,345
[CELL PHONE BEEPS]

2
00:00:02,643 --> 00:00:04,273
(Leonard:)Oh, Howard's losing it.

3
00:00:04,436 --> 00:00:06,566
(Leonard:)Check out his latest Twitters.

4
00:00:06,730 --> 00:00:10,360
"I'm at the bottom of a black hole
staring into the abyss.

5
00:00:10,526 --> 00:00:13,986
(Leonard:)My life is meaningless.
My future is without hope."

6
00:00:14,154 --> 00:00:16,824
(Raj:)Why don't we take him
to see the Blue Man Group?

7
00:00:17,741 --> 00:00:18,821
(Leonard:)You think that'd help?

8
00:00:18,992 --> 00:00:22,792
(Raj:)USA Today calls them
"Exuberant fun for the whole family."

9
00:00:23,205 --> 00:00:26,585
(Leonard:)I don't know. Howard isn't really
the "family fun" kind of guy.

10
00:00:27,668 --> 00:00:29,668
(Raj:)It's too bad he wasn't here
for that hooker.

11
00:00:29,837 --> 00:00:31,877
She's exactly his type:

12
00:00:32,047 --> 00:00:33,717
(Raj:)A hooker.

13
00:00:34,633 --> 00:00:38,133
(Raj:)You know, I bet if we hired her,
that would cheer him up.

14
00:00:38,303 --> 00:00:40,933
(Leonard:)We're not going to get
Wolowitz a hooker.

15
00:00:41,098 --> 00:00:42,558
[CELL PHONE BEEPS]

16
00:00:45,185 --> 00:00:47,105
"I'm so lonely and horny...

17
00:00:47,271 --> 00:00:51,771
(Raj(reading Howard's twitter):)...I may open this $20 jar of peanuts
and end it all."

18
00:00:56,321 --> 00:01:04,021
I suppose it wouldn't hurt
to get an estimate.

